# Keep the build context small and free of secrets.
#
# NEVER let .env or secrets/ into an image: `.env` holds the Supabase service-role
# key, the WhatsApp token and the Azure key. The container takes those as runtime
# environment variables (docker run --env-file .env) or from the platform's secret
# store — never baked into a layer.

.git
.gitignore
.github
.venv
venv
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
secrets/

# Batch pipeline code + artefacts the service never uses (see the Dockerfile header)
scripts/
migrations/
data/
dist/
*.log
*.out
tile_test.tif

# Docs / tooling noise
*.md
CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT*
